	"data": "Goal: Spatial Navigation\n\nFly, walk, and teleport through thought space. Portals between clusters. Infinite canvas in 3D.\n\nWhat This Is\nThe movement system for navigating the spatial thought graph. Thought spaces can be enormous — you need smooth, comfortable, multi-scale navigation.\n\nSpecific Behaviors Needed\nWalk — room-scale movement for examining nearby bubbles\nFly — smooth locomotion through larger thought spaces\nTeleport — instant jump to distant clusters (XR Tools teleport)\nPortals —…",
